=== Prompt ===
Who is Harry Potter?

=== Response ===
Harry Potter is a fictional character and the main protagonist in a series of seven fantasy novels written by British author J.K. Rowling. The series, which includes the Harry Potter books, the Harry Potter films, over a dozen accompanying books, and the Harry Potter video games, is one of the best-selling and most popular book series in history.

Harry Potter is an orphan who lives with his unloving aunt, uncle, and cousin. At the age of 11, he learns that he is a wizard and is invited to attend Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. Throughout the series, Harry faces numerous challenges, including battles against the dark wizard Lord Voldemort. He is known for his bravery, loyalty, and resourcefulness.

The Harry Potter series has had a significant impact on popular culture, and Harry Potter himself has become a beloved and iconic character in the world of literature and beyond.

